From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt Graham <matt.sg@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:25:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/12] input, usb: XInput/SDL3 pads over the shared key map

The pad backend is XInput on Windows and SDL3 elsewhere, with RECOMP_PADMAP
and capture neutralisation. The keyboard is upstream's key table and map,
with RECOMP_KEYMAP overrides and RECOMP_MENU_KEYS menu navigation. The OHCI
trap covers every x86-64 host.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
